{"id":"prilozhit_","lemma":"приложить","pos":"verb","rank":4725,"glosses":["to put (next to)","to enclose, to join, to attach","to apply, to use"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3a/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B6%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"приложу","2s":"приложишь","3s":"приложит","1p":"приложим","2p":"приложите","3p":"приложат"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"приложи","2p":"приложите"}}},"past":{"m":"приложил","p":"приложили","f":"приложила","n":"приложило"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"прикладывать","examples":[{"text":"Вы должны приложить усилие.","en":"You must make an effort.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,null,{"g":"effort"}]},{"text":"Ума не приложу, что делать.","en":"I'm at my wit's end.","words":[{"g":"mind","l":"ум"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to make, to do"}]},{"text":"Я приложил палец к губам.","en":"I put my finger to my lips.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"finger or toe"},{"g":"to"},null]},{"text":"Тебе нужно лишь приложить все усилия.","en":"All you have to do is do your best.","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"only, merely, just"},null,{"g":"everyone, everybody"},null]},{"text":"Том приложил телефон к уху.","en":"Tom put the phone to his ear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655460","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"telephone"},{"g":"to"},null]}]}